## Expense Tracker

### Transaction Model

```xiom
enum ExpenseCategory {
  Food;
  Transport;
  Entertainment;
  Bills;
  Shopping;
  Other;
}

type Expense {
  description: Str;
  amount: Int;
  category: ExpenseCategory;
  day: Int;
}

fn category_name(cat: ExpenseCategory) -> Str {
  match cat {
    ExpenseCategory.Food => "Food",
    ExpenseCategory.Transport => "Transport",
    ExpenseCategory.Entertainment => "Entertainment",
    ExpenseCategory.Bills => "Bills",
    ExpenseCategory.Shopping => "Shopping",
    ExpenseCategory.Other => "Other",
  }
}
```

### The Ledger

```xiom
type Ledger {
  expenses: Vec[Expense];
  monthly_budget: Int;
}

fn create_ledger(budget: Int) -> Ledger {
  Ledger{ expenses: Vec[Expense].new(), monthly_budget: budget }
}

fn add_expense(ledger: &mut Ledger, desc: Str, amt: Int, cat: ExpenseCategory, day: Int) {
  ledger.expenses.push(Expense{ description: desc, amount: amt, category: cat, day: day });
}
```

### Category Summaries

```xiom
fn category_total(ledger: &Ledger, cat: ExpenseCategory) -> Int {
  let mut total = 0;
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < ledger.expenses.len() {
    let exp = ledger.expenses.get(i).unwrap();
    if exp.category == cat {
      total += exp.amount;
    };
    i += 1;
  };
  total
}

fn summarize_by_category(ledger: &Ledger) -> Map[Str, Int] {
  let mut summary: Map[Str, Int] = Map[Str, Int].new();
  let categories: Vec[ExpenseCategory] = Vec[ExpenseCategory].new();
  categories.push(ExpenseCategory.Food);
  categories.push(ExpenseCategory.Transport);
  categories.push(ExpenseCategory.Entertainment);
  categories.push(ExpenseCategory.Bills);
  categories.push(ExpenseCategory.Shopping);

  let mut i = 0;
  while i < categories.len() {
    let cat = categories.get(i).unwrap();
    let total = category_total(ledger, cat);
    summary.insert(category_name(cat), total);
    i += 1;
  };
  summary
}
```

### Total Spending and Biggest Expense

```xiom
fn total_spent(ledger: &Ledger) -> Int {
  let mut total = 0;
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < ledger.expenses.len() {
    total += ledger.expenses.get(i).unwrap().amount;
    i += 1;
  };
  total
}

fn find_biggest(ledger: &Ledger) -> Expense {
  let mut biggest = ledger.expenses.get(0).unwrap();
  let mut i = 1;
  while i < ledger.expenses.len() {
    let exp = ledger.expenses.get(i).unwrap();
    if exp.amount > biggest.amount { biggest = exp; };
    i += 1;
  };
  biggest
}
```

### Budget Alerts

```xiom
fn check_budget(ledger: &Ledger) -> Str {
  let spent = total_spent(ledger);
  let remaining = ledger.monthly_budget - spent;

  if spent > ledger.monthly_budget {
    return "OVER BUDGET!";
  };
  if spent >= ledger.monthly_budget * 80 / 100 {
    return "WARNING: 80%+ used";
  };
  "On track"
}
```

### Report Generation

```xiom
fn print_report(ledger: &Ledger) {
  io.println("EXPENSE REPORT");
  io.println(total_spent(ledger));
  io.println(ledger.monthly_budget);
  io.println(check_budget(ledger));

  let biggest = find_biggest(ledger);
  io.println(biggest.description);
  io.println(biggest.amount);

  let summary = summarize_by_category(ledger);
  io.println(summary.get("Food").unwrap_or(0));
  io.println(summary.get("Transport").unwrap_or(0));
}
```

